action."},{"depth":1,"text":"> The original fix is still needed for the Lenovo Yoga 7 14AGP11"},{"depth":1,"text":"touchscreen race the commit addressed, but a corrected version will"},{"depth":1,"text":"be resubmitted once the EC bus-mastering interaction is understood"},{"depth":1,"text":"and handled properly, rather than reintroducing a different"},{"depth":1,"text":"regression on more widely-used ThinkPad hardware in the meantime."},{"depth":1,"text":"> Reported-by: Thorsten Leemhuis <linux@leemhuis.info>"},{"depth":1,"text":"Closes: https://lore.kernel.org/all/b4a4eadb-282f-464c-843a-19d415a34d0c@leemhuis.info/"},{"depth":1,"text":"Signed-off-by: Hardik Prakash <hardikprakash.official@gmail.com>"}],"lineCount":19,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Reviewed-by: Mario Limonciello (AMD) <superm1@kernel.org>> ---"},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":1,"text":"  drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-designware-platdrv.c | 80 ---------------------"},{"depth":1,"text":"  1 file changed, 80 deletions(-)"},{"depth":1,"text":"> diff --git a/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-designware-platdrv.c b/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-designware-platdrv.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"index c8a203fff4d1..6d6e81242f74 100644"},{"depth":1,"text":"--- a/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-designware-platdrv.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"+++ b/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-designware-platdrv.c"},{"depth":1,"text":"@@ -8,14 +8,12 @@"},{"depth":1,"text":"   * Copyright (C) 2007 MontaVista Software Inc."},{"depth":1,"text":"   * Copyright (C) 2009 Provigent Ltd."},{"depth":1,"text":"   */"},{"depth":1,"text":"-#include <linux/acpi.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"  #include <linux/clk-provider.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"  #include <linux/clk.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"  #include <linux/delay.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"  #include <linux/dmi.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"  #include <linux/err.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"  #include <linux/errno.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"-#include <linux/gpio/driver.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"  #include <linux/i2c.h>"},{"depth":1,"text":"  #includ